<<Act Commander officer left center blue>>
Commander: A cargo ship exploded in the port this morning. The Skibidi government is on high alert, considering it an act of war. Naval ships are guarding all trade routes. 

<<Act Lookout scout right center green>>
Lookout: Commander, an undetected vessel has been spotted nearby. What should we do?

-> Do nothing
	<<jump DoNothing>>
-> Tell the naval ships to check a different area
	<<jump DiffArea>>
-> Report this to the navy
	<<jump ReportNavy>>

